#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): 32-bit (Long) arithmetic in the body on 16F1829
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 10,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Dim BW As Long
Repeat For 5 ms
    BW = BW + 1
End Repeat
Do
Loop
